  "notes": "One real connected creative protocol777 client. Damage is unattributed generic damage, not an explosion. Freeze and exact tick barriers isolate the twenty-tick retaliation delay. Reposition boss each tick to isolate the destruction volume from wandering. Repeat with mob_griefing=false and block_drops=false; no skull targets are present. No client visual proof."
